Subject: [PATCH 4/7] fix(tollwallet): map sidecar wire keys explicitly
 (quote_id/fee_reserve)

The sidecar client unmarshalled daemon results straight into the port's
MintQuote/MeltQuote/MeltResult, which have no JSON tags, so snake_case keys from
the daemon (quote_id, fee_reserve, ...) did not map to the Go fields (QuoteID,
FeeReserve) and were silently dropped. Found against the real daemon on the
MT6000: RequestMintQuote lost the quote id.

Use explicit wire structs with json tags for request_mint_quote,
request_melt_quote and melt; update the test fake to emit the canonical
snake_case wire format. Tests green.
